{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-203151-r4513513","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Grilled Mesquite Meatloaf","sourcePageId":203151,"sourceRevision":"4513513","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-19T01:05:49Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Grilled%20Mesquite%20Meatloaf&oldid=4513513","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:54:35.000Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Grilled recipes","Category:Main course recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes using bread crumb","Category:Recipes using celery","Category:Recipes using chile flake","Category:Recipes using ground beef","Category:Recipes using ketchup","Category:Recipes using lemon juice","Category:Recipes using onion","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"9d99308739b710b2a0b679acdb7ffce6f444f7f9d07ef7519678680c8bddc22b","sourceWikitext":"{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Meat recipes\n| Difficulty = 3\n}}\n\n{{recipe}}\n \nUnlike regular meatloaf, which is baked in an oven, this version is grilled over mesquite to form a nice crust and smoky flavor.\n\n== Ingredients ==\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|Tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Olive Oil|olive oil]]\n* ½ large [[Cookbook:Onion|onion]], [[Cookbook:Dice|diced]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]], plus a [[Cookbook:Pinch|pinch]]\n* 3 Tbsp [[Cookbook:Mincing|minced]] [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]]\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] diced [[Cookbook:Celery|celery]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Pound|pound]] (450 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]]) ground [[Cookbook:Beef#Chuck|chuck]] (20% fat)\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Lemon|lemons]], juiced\n* 1 tsp freshly-ground [[Cookbook:Black Pepper|black pepper]]\n* 1 ½ tsp [[Cookbook:Red pepper flakes|red pepper flakes]]\n* ¼ cup [[Cookbook:Worcestershire Sauce|Worcestershire sauce]]\n* ½ cup panko [[Cookbook:Breadcrumbs|breadcrumbs]]\n* 2 Tbsp [[Cookbook:Ketchup|ketchup]]\n* ½ pound (225 g) charcoal briquets\n* 1 cup soaked mesquite chips\n\n== Procedure ==\n#Heat oil in a large [[Cookbook:Sauté Pan|sauté pan]] over medium-high heat. Add onion and a pinch of kosher salt, and cook until translucent. \n#Add garlic and cook until garlic reaches a golden color.\n#Add celery and cook until lightly browned around edges. Set aside until cool.\n#Mix together ground chuck, onion mixture, lemon juice, pepper, red pepper flakes, Worcestershire sauce, and breadcrumbs. Shape into a 3½ x 7½-[[Cookbook:Inch|inch]] loaf about 2 inches thick. [[Cookbook:Brush|Brush]] with ketchup and set aside.\n#Heat charcoal in a large chimney starter. Once hot, evenly distribute around the bottom of the [[Cookbook:Grill|grill]] and mix with mesquite. Reapply the grate and place the loaf on top.\n#[[Cookbook:Grilling|Grill]], covered, turning often, until internal temperature reaches 160°F (72˚C).\n#Remove from heat and let rest for 10 minutes.\n#Serve thick slices with mashed potatoes, roast vegetables, and gravy.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using ground beef]]\n[[Category:Recipes using onion]]\n[[Category:Grilled recipes]]\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bread crumb]]\n[[Category:Recipes using celery]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chile flake]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon juice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ketchup]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Grilled Mesquite Meatloaf","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"2 Tbsp olive oil","sourceText":"2 Tbsp olive oil","amountText":"2 Tbsp olive oil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"½ large onion, diced","sourceText":"½ large onion, diced","amountText":"½ large onion, diced","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 tsp salt, plus a pinch","sourceText":"1 tsp salt, plus a pinch","amountText":"1 tsp salt, plus a pinch","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"3 Tbsp minced garlic","sourceText":"3 Tbsp minced garlic","amountText":"3 Tbsp minced garlic","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"½ cup diced celery","sourceText":"½ cup diced celery","amountText":"½ cup diced celery","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"1 pound (450 g) ground chuck (20% fat)","sourceText":"1 pound (450 g) ground chuck (20% fat)","amountText":"1 pound (450 g) ground chuck (20% fat)","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"2 lemons, juiced","sourceText":"2 lemons, juiced","amountText":"2 lemons, juiced","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"1 tsp freshly-ground black pepper","sourceText":"1 tsp freshly-ground black pepper","amountText":"1 tsp freshly-ground black pepper","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-9","name":"1 ½ tsp red pepper flakes","sourceText":"1 ½ tsp red pepper flakes","amountText":"1 ½ tsp red pepper flakes","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-10","name":"¼ cup Worcestershire sauce","sourceText":"¼ cup Worcestershire sauce","amountText":"¼ cup Worcestershire sauce","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":